# Nagata compactification

Every separated morphism of finite type to a quasi-compact, quasi-separated scheme
factors as an open immersion followed by a proper morphism.

The development of this theorem is `WeilConjectures.Compactification`, and
`WeilConjectures.Compactification.NagataCompactification` already states it. Statements
here cite that module instead of restating the theorem.

Blueprint block `sec-nagata-compactification`.
